pulation or another wording of the same aggregate is evidence to the shown aggregate thesis\"）。候选并进已开问题，用它的结果档和到期日<span class=\"src\">PRD 06</span>。只有以共同量理由开题、带量的候选由代码自动判，其余是匹配和碰\n353:<li><b>另一题：</b>同一件事里答案能分开走、分析员会分别下注的：有自己驱动的组成部分；同一笔交易或同一份附注里两个各自会变、分别盯着的数；另一件事<span class=\"src\">D190 碰撞裁决的四种；D248 第 1 条收窄了\"担保和融资\"</span>。</li>\n628:<tr><td>B13</td><td>PRD 06 的重复和替代说法早于 D202、D204</td><td>这一页按 D202、D204 写（第 2 节、5.5）；PRD 06 签字后更新</td><td>D202、D204</td></tr>\n629:<tr><td>B14</td><td>组成部分算不算同一题</td><td>同一总量的另一种人群或口径是同一题；有自己驱动、答案能分开走、分析员会分别下注的是另一题，要过独立意义测试</td><td>D190；第 1 版 §6；D248</td></tr>\n   114\t- **No case-fitted fix.** A hand list, a special path or a rule fitted to the case in view fixes that case and breaks the next. First ask\n   180\t- A re-sent request is the bytes production sends, not the archive's canonical JSON: `model.request_identity` sorts keys for the\n   214\t- **A prompt serves every company, never the bench.** Every analyst prompt is a general hedge-fund brain: each rule and example reads the\n   220\t- **Never grow a prompt to fix quality.** Read the whole request (system, schema, payload) as the model reads it, and list every\n262:class BudgetTransport:\n268:    def __call__(self, *args):\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
